{"unit_id":"sg88__dsh-proxy-switch#card-zh","repo":"sg88/dsh-proxy-switch","commit":"2da87c3243c37dd88bae8d76b43c26581ef1ff78","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy-switch 是供 DSH Web 使用的网络代理插件：当全局 fetch 遇到连接、DNS 或超时等网络错误时，可按设置通过 HTTP CONNECT 或 SOCKS5 隧道重试请求。它在 Web 设置面板提供启用开关、代理地址和选择模式，设置变更会实时读取。适合需要为 DSH 的网络请求配置代理回退的用户；无需 API 密钥，需自行配置可用代理地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-40","lib/proxy-fetch.js:314-337","lib/client.js:274-284"]}
{"unit_id":"sg88__dsh-proxy-switch#card-en","repo":"sg88/dsh-proxy-switch","commit":"2da87c3243c37dd88bae8d76b43c26581ef1ff78","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-proxy-switch adds proxy fallback to DSH Web. When a direct fetch fails with a network error, it can retry through an HTTP CONNECT or SOCKS5 tunnel. The Web settings panel controls the fallback, proxy addresses, and mode. Users configure a working proxy; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-40","lib/proxy-fetch.js:314-337","lib/client.js:274-284"]}
